@tool
extends EditorPlugin
## FPS Controller editor plugin.
##
## Library addon: ships the first-person player scene, movement states, camera,
## hands viewmodel, grab controller, projectile and example props for direct use,
## so there is nothing to auto-register. The plugin entry exists only so the addon
## can be enabled/disabled and published to the Asset Library.
##
## Depends on the Core, Components and Inventory kits (enable those too).
